# One field from aa-counter-guard: a first-wave-sized party assaults
# remembered enemy extractors by attack-move. Intel is fed by ordinary
# contact (no scout in this arm -- one variable at a time), so the raid hits
# income the fighting has already revealed ([[policy-holding-ground]]).

name aa-counter-guard-raid
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
